# Base system. Packages come from the CachyOS repositories (Arch packages rebuilt for newer
# processors) first and the Arch repositories second; see docs/DECISIONS.md.
base linux-cachyos linux-cachyos-headers cachyos-keyring cachyos-mirrorlist cachyos-v3-mirrorlist
cachyos-settings ananicy-cpp cachyos-ananicy-rules
# All device firmware (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, graphics, audio, network), so no
# chip is left without its firmware. Microcode and drivers come from desktop/hardware/packages.list.
linux-firmware
btrfs-progs cryptsetup dosfstools efibootmgr sudo nano less bash-completion man-db
networkmanager wpa_supplicant openssh
snapper zram-generator pacman-contrib rsync arch-install-scripts
# The first update ranks the official mirrors; the desktop commands use curl for AUR lookups and weather.
curl reflector
power-profiles-daemon bluez bluez-utils
pipewire pipewire-pulse pipewire-alsa pipewire-jack wireplumber rtkit alsa-utils upower
polkit bubblewrap python git github-cli base-devel mise pciutils usbutils
